.jpg"},{"photo_id":"qOnOihEbMo_0h1FQfaWrAw","business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","label":"menu","selection_rank":4,"width":400,"height":400,"image_url":"/photos/qOnOihEbMo_0h1FQfaWrAw.jpg"},{"photo_id":"QfaTi49aq75eI1nf1MomDA","business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","label":"food","selection_rank":5,"width":600,"height":400,"image_url":"/photos/QfaTi49aq75eI1nf1MomDA.jpg"}],"review_excerpts":[]},"ranking":{"user_row":3279,"user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","business_row":1077,"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","nv_rank":418,"mm_rank":441,"nv_score":0.5589116215705872,"mm_score":0.47050076723098755,"rank_movement":-23,"has_visual_feature":true,"name":"The Big Cheezy","address":"422 1/2 S Broad St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70119","stars":4.0,"review_count":181,"categories":["Salad","Burgers","American (Traditional)","Soup","Sandwiches","Restaurants"],"is_open":false},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":418,"mm_rank":441,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":4,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Salad","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Burgers","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"American (Traditional)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Soup","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Sandwiches","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Soup","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","review_id":"MEPlSPsSuI2YS9riRk4yCw","date":"2015-08-12T17:16:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412119388580322,"text_excerpt":"AHHHH! Cheese. I love cheese. The big cheezy offers much more than just a grilled cheese sandwich. All of their sandwiches have a buttery, crispy, perfectly toasted bread, with delicious and warm inside. I tried the craw gator - yum. My roommate had the BLT cheese one I forget the exact name. She loved hers. Fries don't come with the sandwich but two people can share one order. I got the tomato basil dipper and that was yummy too. This is where you go for your cheat meal, because it's definitely artery clogging deliciousness. From the front of the building, park on the left side, not the right side. Their parking is minimal."},{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","review_id":"rhtGLHTYlgLGZP3N-sdVIg","date":"2015-05-18T05:03:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372332692146301,"text_excerpt":"I've only tried the Mac and Cheesy with fries, so I can't vouch for the rest of the menu, but it's pretty yummy. I really expected the main focus to be the sandwich and the fries leave something to be desired, but I was wrong. Even the waffle fries were impressive. I would like to offer a tip. When you get your food, don't dive in right away. It's very tempting, but it turns into a mess. If you let it cool for a few minutes, the cheese hardens a little, and it's much more manageable to eat. It tastes just as good not piping hot. My only gripe with Big Cheezy is the parking. It's very limited and not \"big car\" friendly. Don't let it deter you from trying it though!"},{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","review_id":"sbtvySFeldDBHbyjgwbSnw","date":"2015-03-28T13:40:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9356060028076172,"text_excerpt":"BLUF: My mission in life used to be to provide for my children; it is now to eat everything The Big Cheezy has to offer. I am lactose intolerant but it is worth it. (4 star food overall but 5 star draw, experience and originality) First off, I dont have children, but I still want to try everything here. (I really am lactose intolerant but I have pills for that). I love grilled cheese but really only had the standard grilled cheese. This place has a pretty diverse menu with specialty grilled cheeses with all kinds of different toppings. If you dont like their creations you can get creative and build your own which is an awesome option. I got The Juice which is roast beef debris and cheese ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","photo_id":"qOnOihEbMo_0h1FQfaWrAw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/qOnOihEbMo_0h1FQfaWrAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9032478332519531},{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","photo_id":"0E3cn53M1ACERMs6sBwWgw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0E3cn53M1ACERMs6sBwWgw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8883413076400757},{"business_id":"R46XVcmUzy8qeerHyZQtEg","photo_id":"fDBnvHNJMmrR71eLKw-7sA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fDBnvHNJMmrR71e